  "story": {
    "title": "Cloud Ice-cream",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Sarla liked to fly a kite. The kite also liked being with Sarla. It always tried to please Sarla. It even changed colour!",
      "When Sarla laughed, it turned pink. If Sarla was angry, it grew red. When Sarla was sad, the kite would turn blue. Sometimes it even turned yellow. When Sarla chattered happily, it grew green.",
      "One day, the kite soared high in the sky. Sarla giggled as she held the string and said, “Fly! Fly higher, kite!”",
      "The kite flew higher and went past the clouds. It met a little fairy there. The fairy was happy to meet the kite too. They whispered to each other. They even flew together.",
      "Sarla pulled at the string as it was getting late. The kite said, “I must go now. My friend is calling me.” The fairy gave her a parting gift of Cloud Ice-cream. It was fluffy and soft!",
      "The kite said, “We will meet again.” “I’ll come and see you,” said the fairy. The kite gave the fairy’s gift to Sarla. Cloud Ice-cream!",
      "“You are my lovely kite!” said Sarla."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Sarla liked to fly a kite.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sarla thích thả diều."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The kite also liked being with Sarla.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con diều cũng thích ở bên Sarla."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It always tried to please Sarla.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó luôn cố gắng làm Sarla vui."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It even changed colour!",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó còn đổi màu nữa!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When Sarla laughed, it turned pink.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi Sarla cười, nó chuyển sang màu hồng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "If Sarla was angry, it grew red.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nếu Sarla giận, nó hóa đỏ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When Sarla was sad, the kite would turn blue.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi Sarla buồn, con diều sẽ chuyển sang màu xanh dương."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sometimes it even turned yellow.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đôi khi nó còn chuyển sang màu vàng nữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When Sarla chattered happily, it grew green.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi Sarla nói chuyện ríu rít vui vẻ, nó hóa xanh lá cây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One day, the kite soared high in the sky.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, con diều bay vút lên cao trên bầu trời."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sarla giggled as she held the string and said, “Fly!",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sarla khúc khích cười khi giữ dây và nói, “Bay lên!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Fly higher, kite!”",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bay cao hơn nữa nhé, diều ơi!”"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The kite flew higher and went past the clouds.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con diều bay cao hơn và vượt qua những đám mây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It met a little fairy there.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó gặp một cô tiên nhỏ ở đó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The fairy was happy to meet the kite too.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô tiên cũng vui khi gặp con diều."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They whispered to each other.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng thì thầm với nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They even flew together.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng còn bay cùng nhau nữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sarla pulled at the string as it was getting late.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sarla kéo dây diều xuống vì trời đã tối."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The kite said, “I must go now.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con diều nói, “Mình phải đi bây giờ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My friend is calling me.” The fairy gave her a parting gift of Cloud Ice-cream.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn mình đang gọi.” Cô tiên tặng nó một món quà chia tay là Kem Mây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It was fluffy and soft!",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó mềm mại và xốp!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The kite said, “We will meet again.” “I’ll come and see you,” said the fairy.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con diều nói, “Chúng ta sẽ gặp lại.” “Mình sẽ đến thăm bạn,” cô tiên nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The kite gave the fairy’s gift to Sarla. Cloud Ice-cream!",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con diều đưa món quà của cô tiên cho Sarla. Kem Mây!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“You are my lovely kite!” said Sarla.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_167646/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Bạn là con diều đáng yêu của mình!” Sarla nói."
      }
    ]
  },
